# Cloudflare static-assets redirects. Copied into out/ by `next build`, then
# extended by scripts/postbuild.mjs with a 301 from the slashless form of every
# page. https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
# The first matching rule wins.

# 1. English moved from /en/ to the root (Finnish now lives under /fi/). The
#    English paths are otherwise unchanged, so every old /en/ link maps 1:1.
/en      /         301
/en/*    /:splat   301

# 2. Removed pricing anchors (/#pricing, /tesla/#pricing, #hinnasto) cannot be
#    redirected here: browsers never send the fragment. The head script in
#    lib/offer.ts sends them to the contact page instead.

# 3. Google Search Console's verification file must answer at its exact URL.
#    Status 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect. Keep while the property is verified.
/googlef5fb86be7b72c0c2.html  /googlef5fb86be7b72c0c2  200
